{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49424","headline":"谒金门 · 牛希济","name":"谒金门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋已暮，重叠关山岐路。\n嘶马摇鞭何处去，晓禽霜满树。\n梦断禁城钟鼓，泪滴枕檀无数。\n一点凝红和薄雾，翠蛾愁不语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}